abstract: >-
  Architecture-aware in silico capsule-typing research prototype for
  Glaesserella parasuis, integrating capsule gene content, genomic
  architecture, and diagnostic-region evidence for serovar-associated
  genomic interpretation. Gparatype has not undergone independent external
  validation and is not intended for standalone clinical or diagnostic use.

keywords:
  - "Glaesserella parasuis"
  - "capsule locus"
  - "serovar"
  - "genomic typing"
  - "capsule typing"
  - "research software"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Ekuufire/Gparatype-public"

license: "MIT"

